/// from future selection while historical {@link broker_desk_documents} keep
/// the rendered content they were produced with. Creation, revision, and
/// retirement are reserved to {@link broker_desk_admins}; the authoring
/// administrator is recorded for accountability.
///
/// @namespace Document
/// @author AutoBE - https://github.com/wrtnlabs/autobe
